    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2>The goal is simple, go fast. Every level can be completed in thousands of different ways, but only 1 is the fastest. Your first try might be slow, but by your 10th try you'll be flying through the level at insane speeds. The more levels you complete the easier finding the fastest paths will become. <br>To distinguish the fast from the slow you can earn medals ranging from bronze to gold if you hit a certain record.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Awesome parkour levels<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502890/extras/15d4fc1d9665af268096f56c14a1e656.poster.avif?t=1724438941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502890/extras/15d4fc1d9665af268096f56c14a1e656.webm?t=1724438941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502890/extras/15d4fc1d9665af268096f56c14a1e656.mp4?t=1724438941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Gravity Control<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502890/extras/b9caa22620550d830b0b23a71415ac11.poster.avif?t=1724438941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502890/extras/b9caa22620550d830b0b23a71415ac11.webm?t=1724438941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502890/extras/b9caa22620550d830b0b23a71415ac11.mp4?t=1724438941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Epic movement<br><br></li><li>Balls</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2>The goal is simple, go fast. Every level can be completed in thousands of different ways, but only 1 is the fastest. Your first try might be slow, but by your 10th try you'll be flying through the level at insane speeds. The more levels you complete the easier finding the fastest paths will become. <br>To distinguish the fast from the slow you can earn medals ranging from bronze to gold if you hit a certain record.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Awesome parkour levels<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502890/extras/15d4fc1d9665af268096f56c14a1e656.poster.avif?t=1724438941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502890/extras/15d4fc1d9665af268096f56c14a1e656.webm?t=1724438941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502890/extras/15d4fc1d9665af268096f56c14a1e656.mp4?t=1724438941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Gravity Control<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502890/extras/b9caa22620550d830b0b23a71415ac11.poster.avif?t=1724438941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502890/extras/b9caa22620550d830b0b23a71415ac11.webm?t=1724438941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502890/extras/b9caa22620550d830b0b23a71415ac11.mp4?t=1724438941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li>Epic movement<br><br></li><li>Balls</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In this 3D platformer you have to parkour your way to the end of each level as fast as you can. You have a ton of control over your movement meaning you can precisely control how you move which makes the game very skill based. Try and try again until you beat the record, that is the goal.",
